<description>&lt;p&gt;Rebel forces have launched attacks that killed at least 15 civilians in Tonj East and another 15 in other locations, while a cattle raid in Duk County left six dead, including a prominent wrestler. A large-scale killing of nearly 200 people was reported in Ruweng, prompting a government condemnation and investigation, and dozens are feared missing after an assault on Miny Island in Jonglei. The national election has been postponed again, now scheduled for February 2027, and a Sudanese official has accused Ethiopia and South Sudan of fueling regional instability. These incidents add mass rebel violence, a major civilian death toll, and political delays not mentioned in the previous briefing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Hindu&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOR0xfXzRQS1hPdU1mTE56ekdPOTNsVUVwMXp3RllPdWNYcEQ3SjNITE1BeUFBeDVENG5pUkxlNmRfd3F3LV9yU2tkd2dWMGZOR0dHWUtFODlyNmNZbjdKSERxbVBVUy1xOFhTaVNDdDhZM1VYVF9BZVJMSmxlRm5JbHV5OVpoVTFDZ0lnTFI4WFU0Q0dXejRtZFJhcVVtQk5WWUZqYWhnbw?oc=5&quot;&gt;NewsBytes&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eye Radio&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxOWGwxSGZuZlBqQnQ3bTlTdzlkVUFBTDdrUXFjQm93MWZvTHQyYzFreWZscGhVUjVSdERiekdGU0QtbjBBUVA4OFc2NUwyTFZpaWUtM2VJOTRZdnRUSFc2VU05bTM5emdCX3NlVVc2ampuNV9UUnFNbkM2LW5KT0I0QWNXX0ExbWRCazZHUzlZaFQzVnJw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Hürriyet Daily News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQNDlEbFFqNV9idmhGSWo4RzVkTFA4cTd2S01JQ1RhcTY3UU4tdTBIbVpZcnMwY3R5SkU3UDhuU1RQOHNOV2tPSndlQ0JhMERSd25zSUNQdS01VUNXeW1rWGtMUG1QNXpRVDRxSE1BdlF5V3d1VGpGWGpKMUkxX1dnRnFDRVpwc2prMk9zMWl6Tk5aSU13S1pUZ1RMemdwT0FEZXZWOQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Christian Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quo